    "markdown": "# Logical\n![](/images/logical.png){style=\"width:200px; background:white; border-radius:15px; border: white solid 5px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\n<u id='logical_tooltip'>__Logical__</u> values can be __TRUE__ or __FALSE__. \n\nThey are primarily used when comparing objects.\n\n## Numerical comparisons\n![](/images/greater_or_equal.png){style=\"width:150px; background:white; border-radius:5px; border: white solid 0px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nRun the below commands to output <u id='logical_tooltip'>__Logical__</u> values using the various __<u id='logical_tooltip'>logical</u> <u id='operator_tooltip'>operators</u>__.\n\n::: {.callout-note}\nWhen an exclamation mark (`!`) is used in <u id='operator_tooltip'>__operators__</u> it means \"not\". When used, the exclamation mark (`!`) always goes at the front of the operator.\n:::\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n#Logical\n# 2 less than 4\n2 < 4\n# 2 greater than 4\n2 > 4\n# 2 less than or equal to 4\n2 <= 4\n# 2 greater than or equal to 4\n2 >= 4\n# 2 equal to 4\n2 == 4\n# 2 not equal to 4\n2 != 4\n```\n:::\n\n\nIt is probably not immediately obvious how useful <u id='logical_tooltip'>__logicals__</u> are, but you'll see their usefulness later in the course.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-51639e1298c2ccb10552\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-51639e1298c2ccb10552\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, /, *, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a5074ae5f8f03edac8b5\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a5074ae5f8f03edac8b5\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of an R object with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-343e850fc393479e5bc9\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-343e850fc393479e5bc9\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs a specific task\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-9fde706facffe9179ed9\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-9fde706facffe9179ed9\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object data type, e.g. integer, double, string, and logical\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-fe986d26d842f6748ad9\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-fe986d26d842f6748ad9\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_structure_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object structure type, e.g. scalar, vector, and data frame\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-361594d8098226ccd705\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-361594d8098226ccd705\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number without decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-64deaa89071f656c881a\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-64deaa89071f656c881a\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"double_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number with decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-cc311c79371696fafdec\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-cc311c79371696fafdec\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-29dba97a8a80624f50af\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-29dba97a8a80624f50af\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"logical_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"TRUE or FALSE\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8033c36b7bb9896287b3\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8033c36b7bb9896287b3\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"scalar_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"A single value in a object\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-3458166a26c63d5539f7\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-3458166a26c63d5539f7\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"vector_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogenous 1-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-2096045d2b1cf8079079\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-2096045d2b1cf8079079\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"matrix_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogeneous 2-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-5caf39a3cc42b5174344\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-5caf39a3cc42b5174344\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_frame_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Heterogeneous 2-dimensional data structure. Each column is homogeneous\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
